s2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p009:m0101","quote":"秀"}],"identity_note":"限固定晉書039荀勖完整單元之具名/稱號；無明載不補本名、母、生卒及官爵年。名字同字不合併；嗣不當生父。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"kbq_kjc_n2f_A","source_assertion_id":"a-sgz023-peiqian-xiu-father-qian","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p006","quote":"《魏略》曰：時遠近皆云當爲公，會病亡。始潛自感所生微賤，無舅氏，又爲父所不禮，即折節仕進，雖多所更歷，清省恪然。每之官，不將妻子。妻子貧乏，織藜芘以自供。又潛爲兗州時，嘗作一胡床，及其去也，留以掛柱。又以父在京師，出入薄軬車；羣弟之田廬，常步行；家人小大或幷日而食；其家敎上下相奉，事有似於石奮。其履檢校度，自魏興少能及者。潛爲人材博，有雅（要）容，然但如此而已，終無所推進，故世歸其絜而不宗其餘。","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p006:m0020"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p007","quote":"子秀嗣。遺令儉葬，墓中惟置一坐，瓦器數枚，其餘一無所設。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p007:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"本源明父子支援的近系結構位置；字母不是排行，不據新唐遠譜接祖。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei-ws2506399","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0074","c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0100"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0074","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0074"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0100","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-035-peixiu-peiwei:p001:m0100"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_co